# The kernel's review (roadmap os-server.md P15), finding 2: THREAD_FRAME's write of a ring-3 thread's CS 0008h makes
# its RPL the thread's ring; the way back refuses it, a fault, never ring 0
# (before: the kernel ran the caller's IP at CPL 0). tests/programs/
# additions.asm, TEST_RV_FRAME; Bochs, whose timing the races need.
program: additions
define: TEST_CAPS
define: TEST_RV_FRAME
emulators: bochs
match: contains
timeout: 60
---
additions: FRAME_WRITE of CS 0008h: 0
rx286: program fault #GP(0008) at 000B:03C6
additions: still here: the kernel refused it
additions: done
